===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|wizardries}}

# The art of a [[wizard]]; [[sorcery]].
# Something, such as an [[advanced]] [[technology]], that gives the [[appearance]] of [[magic]].
#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=2001-04-25|author=David H. Crehore|title=Re: OT?:pipe musings on the drive home|url=https://groups.google.com/forum/#!original/alt.smokers.pipes/UmbXn3jyUX8/0mA8pPBsVj0J|newsgroup=alt.smokers.pipes|passage=Filled up the Ashton with Capstan and had a totally British drive home. Thanks to the '''wizardry''' of Ashton and Imperial Tobacco, that first smoke in a new pipe was sweet as a nut.}}
# Great [[ability]] in some specified field.
#: ''He used his computing '''wizardry''' to automate the search-and-replace process.''

